{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"e80810cfd83225a0eb05aa853594cccd36acc2e4dabdc4061c69629577273616","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_6ac8a3b7c3212e6722af7b0f4ab410dbc0abbff8d7feaccc5f0730a10f0c0887","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical method for equivariant pose estimation using warped convolutions. The supplied text does not contain a dedicated section for ethics, privacy, or broader impact, nor does it include a compliance checklist. The use of the AFLW dataset, which contains facial images, is described without explicit discussion of consent, privacy, or ethical considerations. The paper is not anonymized, displaying author names and affiliations, which is consistent with the venue's open review policy but would violate double-blind policies if applicable. No evidence of plagiarism or dual submission is present in the text.","paper_id":"BkmM8Dceg","paper_identity_sha256":"128241786d219be42f90590ec1faf8888e957a79559895bc0f1d13c84c9987de","prompt_identity_sha256":"a8389ff75a8d7326860f4b26cebde937e2fc824461adbfc8ea72e47e2e69fd17","raw_response_sha256":"34e511d9b1194ee0962723a39f02367da52efd2b97f0a7ca023eaa5acb63a6f0","request_identity_sha256":"64c3da3700e73e41722588c7a2ec32e6442d163eadb4ba6a67cb18406df6f511","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"20d9192a3432fe1d09390a0779d762a13612e42a9ad3c2ccf5c896b095c3cb41","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-030","SRC-031"],"review_text":"The paper does not include a dedicated section discussing ethical considerations, potential harms, or responsible AI practices. The experiments involve face pose estimation on the AFLW dataset, which contains images of real people. The text does not address issues such as privacy, consent, or the potential for misuse of facial recognition technology. The absence of such discussion is a limitation, as